// The builtins that return a new string (input, read_all, str_of_mem) and a float
// in string context are fresh too. Right-hand ones are freed once copied: the
// second input, the float, and the second str_of_mem: three.
pair() {
  string s = input() + "-" + input();
} return string s;

rest() {
  string r = read_all() + "." + 1.5;
} return string r;
